.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ITEM REPLACE"
.SH NAME
hamstik release item replace \- Replace the Work Item's release versions with exactly these
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release item replace [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the Work Item's release versions with exactly these
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version ids (UUIDs)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --confirm-released-scope-correction
Confirm correcting the scope of a released Work Item
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the membership changed
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
